# The title's Exit box (the port's Exit item: "Exit?", Yes above No) by the hand: pointed at as the game's own pages are,
# not as a page of rows. The hand on Exit, the trigger, the hand on No, the trigger: the box goes and the game runs on
# (the shot "after-no" is taken). Before 1 November the pointer took this box for VR Options and wrote a row cursor
# of up to four into its two lines.
